          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "業界の筋に詳しい彼なら、今回の合併騒動の裏事情を知っているはずだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "通の筋の間では、この隠れ家的なお店が密かに話題になっている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "マーケットの筋は、今回の金利引き上げをすでに織り込み済みだったようだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 12,
        "gloss": "logical move (in go, shogi, etc.)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "将棋の対局で、相手の王将を追い詰めるための絶妙な筋を見つけ出した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "囲碁の定石を覚えるだけでなく、その場に応じた筋を読めるようになるのが上達の近道だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「今の局面、この一手はどうかな？」「いや、それは筋が悪いよ。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 13,
        "gloss": "ninth vertical line",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "飛車を九筋に移動させて、端からの攻めを狙う作戦に出た。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "九筋の歩を突いて、相手の陣形を揺さぶるタイミングを伺う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "終盤戦、九筋での攻防が勝敗を分ける決定的なポイントとなった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 14,
        "gloss": "seam on a helmet",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
